<title>USA: Fiennes, Cruise among Oscar nominees for best actor.</title>
<headline>Fiennes, Cruise among Oscar nominees for best actor.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The nominees announced Tuesday for the Academy Award for best actor were Tom Cruise for &quot;Jerry Maguire&quot;, Ralph Fiennes for &quot;The English Patient&quot;, Woody Harrelson for &quot;The People vs. Larry Flynt&quot;, Geoffrey Rush for &quot;Shine&quot; and Billy Bob Thornton for &quot;Sling Blade&quot;.</p>
</text>
